{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features","id":836438,"title":"Solar Identifying Features","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-24T08:48:19-08:00","id":836438,"title":"Solar Identifying Features","content":"What are the features or signs that would help the general populace identify a particular individual as a solar anathema or an anathema in general? As opposed to a spirit/god? Obviously anima effects and caste marks but anything else? I'm trying to figure out what the response will be to certain character actions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2987-zeal-dib","name":"Zeal'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T08:56:44-08:00","id":836444,"title":"","content":"-Doing supernatural effects NOT in the name of the Immaculate Order. (Anathema in general)<br /> -Thanking the Unconquered Sun for this Divine Might they're dishing out (Solar Anathema)<br /> -Eating your mom's heart and turning into her. (Anathema in general, though mostly Lunars)<br /> -Being possessed by a demon","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:05:18-08:00","id":836448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836444#post836444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Doing supernatural effects NOT in the name of the Immaculate Order. (Anathema in general)<br /> -Thanking the Unconquered Sun for this Divine Might they're dishing out (Solar Anathema)<br /> -Eating your mom's heart and turning into her. (Anathema in general, though mostly Lunars)<br /> -Being possessed by a demon</div> </div> </div> </div>-Acting above your station as a non-dragonblooded.<br /> -Having non humble ambitions<br /> -Going on a murderous rampage. (I wonder how many mortal mass murderers or Serial killers were branded as Anathema after the fact?)<br /> <br /> Most of these won't get you killed but I imagine you'd get a &quot;Don't do this, or you'll be in danger of being possessed by an Anathema!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-24-2016, 12:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:09:37-08:00","id":836451,"title":"","content":"I <i><b>really</b></i> like that Anathema is not only encouraged as a more broad term this edition, but that if it's specific towards anyone, it's actually <i>Lunars</i>.<br /> <br /> They're the ones that have been the most active in the past thousand-plus years and while the stories talk about Solar Anathema, Lunars are the ones you should <i>stay awake at night in fear of</i>. They could be anyone! Your neighbor, your friend, your parent, your spouse! Only the Immaculate Order can protect you! So you really should let them build an outpost in your little town...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:18:11-08:00","id":836462,"title":"","content":"Don't you mean &quot;<i>discouraged</i> as a broader term&quot;?<br /> <br /> Disregarding that, I find it deeply ironic how the Silver Pact's actions against the Realm actually feed into every stereotype the Immaculate propaganda holds about Lunars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:18:36-08:00","id":836463,"title":"","content":"If a group of guys does this...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://media.animevice.com/uploads/3/31957/551382-GokuGohanTrunks.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> ...they're probably Anathema. :.D<br /> <br /> -To actually contribute, without glowing, it's really, really hard to tell that someone is an Anathema. WIthout using powers, you're basically a rebel and an upstart, but not the deadly threat the Wyld Hunt...hunts.<br /> <br /> But yeah, getting nervous around obvious Terrestrials, avoiding Immaculate places of worship...openly displaying weapons and armor made of pure orichalcum or moonsilver might draw suspicion. As might single handedly beating down a behemoth; sure, the town might be grateful as a whole, but you'll have that one mortal that knows somethings up, and reports you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":697,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/697-arteliex","user":"Arteliex","date":". 02-24-2016, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/697-arteliex","name":"Arteliex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar697_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:20:39-08:00","id":836467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arteliex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836463#post836463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If a group of guys does this...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://media.animevice.com/uploads/3/31957/551382-GokuGohanTrunks.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> ...they're probably Anathema. :.D</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Look like Earth Aspects to me with that Anima Flux ripping their clothes off. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:22:58-08:00","id":836470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836462#post836462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't you mean &quot;<i>discouraged</i> as a broader term&quot;?<br /> <br /> Disregarding that, I find it deeply ironic how the Silver Pact's actions against the Realm actually feed into every stereotype the Immaculate propaganda holds about Lunars.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually did mean encouraged. While Lunars are certainly front and center, there is a sense that rogue gods or various exigents or even a mortal <i>actually </i>possessed by an <i>actual </i>demon would be branded as Anathema. It's more &quot;here's a list of acceptable crap and everything else is bad&quot; sense.<br /> <br /> I could be wrong, I can't seem to remember a quote on this. It was just a sensation. In past editions, it really felt like it was the 5 Solar caste marks that were evil and that's it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:29:33-08:00","id":836474,"title":"","content":"I imagine when a Solar first rides into town, a conversation like this happens.<br /> <br /> Monk 1: And she had a golden glowing circle on her forehead.<br /> Monk 2: Golden? You sure it wasn't silver?<br /> Monk 1: No, sir. Golden as the sun.<br /> Monk 2: As the sun.... *Digs though ancient tomes* What we are dealing with is a &quot;Solar&quot;. <br /> Monk 1: What's a Solar?<br /> Monk 2: They are ancient demons that our Dragonblooded lords slew and locked away in the pits of darkness. <br /> Monk 1: If what we saw today was a Solar...<br /> Monk 2: Then this town is in grave danger.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:29:42-08:00","id":836475,"title":"","content":"I have this idea of an artifact originally used in the first age to alert mortal and DB servants of the approach of their solar masters - basically wind-chimes that would activate if a solar came within a certain range of the chimes.<br /> <br /> ...in the age of sorrows, these chimes would make for dandy solar detectors - though they do not give a direction, so they're largely useless in crowds and whatnot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:42:14-08:00","id":836487,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836475#post836475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have this idea of an artifact originally used in the first age to alert mortal and DB servants of the approach of their solar masters - basically wind-chimes that would activate if a solar came within a certain range of the chimes.<br /> <br /> ...in the age of sorrows, these chimes would make for dandy solar detectors - though they do not give a direction, so they're largely useless in crowds and whatnot.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love this artifact idea. I imagine that the Wind Chimes would be rare as most Anathema have been Lunars and the Wind Chimes don't work on them. <br /> <br /> &quot;Bing was eaten by a Lunar. Fucking Wind Chimes don't work for a damn!&quot; *Throws into fire*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:50:56-08:00","id":836492,"title":"","content":"I did some digging, and there's a slight discrepancy on what is an Anathema - the glossary says this moniker is only applied to Solar, Lunar and recently the Abyssal Exalted, while the setting chapter states the term can be applied to pretty much anything supernatural if it pisses the Realm off.<br /> <br /> I guess in my mind I stuck with the index due to remembering Holden rant about how Alchemicals wouldn't be called Anathema because it makes no sense and because it's not a generic term.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T10:07:55-08:00","id":836503,"title":"","content":"Depends how &quot;downtrodden&quot; you make the world. Mortals are living among a broad number of demi-gods. The Dragonblooded rule as princes of the earth, it's reasonable to think that in many parts of the world the populace is downtrodden with their will to fight broken. The posture of the average mortal is beaten, where an exalted might stand proud and defiant. In a previous edition it was mentioned that many solars became tan, as if they spent a lot of time in the sun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5618-quorumof4","name":"QuorumOf4","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T10:22:08-08:00","id":836509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>QuorumOf4</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836503#post836503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends how &quot;downtrodden&quot; you make the world. Mortals are living among a broad number of demi-gods. The Dragonblooded rule as princes of the earth, it's reasonable to think that in many parts of the world the populace is downtrodden with their will to fight broken. The posture of the average mortal is beaten, where an exalted might stand proud and defiant.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whatever rocks your boat and all that, but I find Exalted works best if its titular heroes aren't sole gems sticking out from the giant pile of shit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T10:33:39-08:00","id":836513,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836509#post836509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whatever rocks your boat and all that, but I find Exalted works best if its titular heroes aren't sole gems sticking out from the giant pile of shit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Having humble ambitions doesn't mean downtrodden. It just means you are going to go to law school to become a lawyer not to weed out corruption in the Thousand Scales. <br /> <br /> The culture of the Blessed Isle is to not rock the boat. Change is bad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T10:41:50-08:00","id":836518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836513#post836513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Having humble ambitions doesn't mean downtrodden. It just means you are going to go to law school to become a lawyer not to weed out corruption in the Thousand Scales.<br /> <br /> The culture of the Blessed Isle is to not rock the boat. Change is bad.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think we're disagreeing. I do disagree with the idea that your average Joe Mortal is a visibly broken man, resigned to being a plaything of the mighty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T10:51:47-08:00","id":836526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>QuorumOf4</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836503#post836503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends how &amp;quot;downtrodden&amp;quot; you make the world. Mortals are living among a broad number of demi-gods. The Dragonblooded rule as princes of the earth, it's reasonable to think that in many parts of the world the populace is downtrodden with their will to fight broken. The posture of the average mortal is beaten, where an exalted might stand proud and defiant. In a previous edition it was mentioned that many solars became tan, as if they spent a lot of time in the sun.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't see a connection between how well you resist oppression and your skin tone... although the mental image of all Exalted being stereotypical Californians does amuse me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T10:53:07-08:00","id":836527,"title":"","content":"I'm assuming the tan thing is a separate point. I think it was in 1e Players Guide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T11:05:17-08:00","id":836536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836451#post836451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I <i><b>really</b></i> like that Anathema is not only encouraged as a more broad term this edition, but that if it's specific towards anyone, it's actually <i>Lunars</i>.<br /> <br /> They're the ones that have been the most active in the past thousand-plus years and while the stories talk about Solar Anathema, Lunars are the ones you should <i>stay awake at night in fear of</i>. They could be anyone! Your neighbor, your friend, your parent, your spouse! Only the Immaculate Order can protect you! So you really should let them build an outpost in your little town...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;They come to us wearing the faces of our dead&quot; is the line that's popular in the Realm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/84-holden","name":"Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar84_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"673"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T11:16:44-08:00","id":836541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836518#post836518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think we're disagreeing. I do disagree with the idea that your average Joe Mortal is a visibly broken man, resigned to being a plaything of the mighty.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I totally agree with your disagree of the average Mortal being the plaything of the mighty. I try to get away from the idea of Dragonblooded as big bullies that shove future's Solars into lockers for shits and giggles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T11:40:31-08:00","id":836558,"title":"","content":"I build my personal Immaculate Order and its dogma around a few core ideas.<br /> 1. It's a completely artificial faith, created from the ground up by incredibly long-lived, patient, and skilled Exalts, and immortal gods.<br /> 2. The faith exists to legitimize and reinforce Dragon-Blooded rule.<br /> 3. It also exists to turn the world against the Lunars and those few Solars still out there.<br /> <br /> With that in mind, I imagine that the &quot;signs&quot; of the Anathema are taught to all, in the same way Western culture tends inculcate imagery of the devil. Millions of children all over Creation know about Caste marks (brands of their treachery and evil!) anima banners (perversions of the pure expressions of elemental anima flux!), and so on. <br /> <br /> Such is the success of the Order that even in places that aren't controlled by them, mortals have heard of the terrifying skin-stealers, and the danger of those who stole the power of the Sun.<br /> <br /> When the farmer in a loyal Realm satrapy is helped by the young girl with a glowing gold circle on her forehead, he's more likely to run in fear than thank her. That's the challenge the returning Lawgivers are up against, and that's the challenge the Lunars face every day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6601-totentanz","name":"Totentanz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T01:12:02-08:00","id":836913,"title":"","content":"I think people have covered most.<br /> I'll also add bestiality. Not that it's something you'd often see, but it's very much associated with the Lunar anathema.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T12:09:48-08:00","id":837141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836487#post836487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I love this artifact idea. I imagine that the Wind Chimes would be rare as most Anathema have been Lunars and the Wind Chimes don't work on them.<br /> <br /> &quot;Bing was eaten by a Lunar. Fucking Wind Chimes don't work for a damn!&quot; *Throws into fire*</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> it also introduces fun alternative gameplay elements - like perception+awareness checks to listen for chimes in the distance, to see if some wyld hunt led by an abbot with some chimes on his staff aren't trailing you...<br /> - this kind of ringed staff perhaps: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khakkhara\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khakkhara</a><br /> <br /> or perhaps stealing the chimes and replacing them with mundane copies...<br /> <br /> Or outbidding a shady guild factor to make sure that an abyssal doesn't get his mummified hands on a set","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":588,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","user":"webkilla","date":". 02-25-2016, 05:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T08:56:10-08:00","id":839219,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836526#post836526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see a connection between how well you resist oppression and your skin tone... although the mental image of all Exalted being stereotypical Californians does amuse me.</div> </div> </div> </div>... because there isn't a connection. Two different statements, I suppose I could of put the last line in a separate paragraph, but then it would of been lonely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5618-quorumof4","name":"QuorumOf4","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T09:15:52-08:00","id":839238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=836526#post836526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see a connection between how well you resist oppression and your skin tone... although the mental image of all Exalted being stereotypical Californians does amuse me.</div> </div> </div> </div>It shouldn't come as a surprise. We're naturally smarter, handsomer, and all-around more talented than most everyone else. When UCS asked Ahlat to scout heroes for the first Solar candidates, he basically started in California.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Share your wonders in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop#post823884\" target=\"_blank\">The Artifact and Evocation Workshop</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1315-ferryman","name":"Ferryman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1315_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T13:15:04-08:00","id":839384,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ferryman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/836438-solar-identifying-features?p=839238#post839238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It shouldn't come as a surprise. We're naturally smarter, handsomer, and all-around more talented than most everyone else. When UCS asked Ahlat to scout heroes for the first Solar candidates, he basically started in California.</div>